<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 pt-24 pb-16 text-center">
  <p class="text-amber-600 font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm mb-3">Coming soon</p>
  <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">Going out of town?<br>Your flock still needs a keeper.</h1>
  <p class="text-lg text-stone-600 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10">
    Roost Assured connects backyard chicken owners with trusted local sitters —
    feeding, egg collection, and coop care while you're away. No more begging a
    neighbor or leaving a five-day feeder and hoping for the best.
  </p>

  <div id="waitlist-form">
    <%= render "waitlist_form", waitlist_signup: @waitlist_signup %>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white border-y border-stone-200">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 py-16 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-10 text-center">
    <div>
      <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🥚</div>
      <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Real local sitters</h3>
      <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm">Find someone nearby who already knows their way around a coop.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="text-3xl mb-3">📸</div>
      <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Photo check-ins</h3>
      <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm">Every visit comes with a photo update, so you always know your flock is fine.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🤝</div>
      <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Two-way trust</h3>
      <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm">Owners and sitters both review each other — no one-sided guessing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-5 py-16 text-center">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Be first in your area</h2>
  <p class="text-stone-600 mb-8">
    We're launching in East Texas first. Join the waitlist and we'll let you know
    the moment Roost Assured is live near you — as an owner looking for a sitter,
    or a sitter looking to earn caring for other people's flocks.
  </p>
  <%= render "waitlist_form", waitlist_signup: WaitlistSignup.new %>
</section>
